@UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### Create (201) or reuse (200) a short URL
POST {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/docs?page=1",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Validation failure (400)
POST {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "javascript:alert(1)"
}

### Update destination and expiration (200); replace Abc1234 with a code returned above.
### Management endpoints are unauthenticated: controlled assessment/demo use only.
PUT {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/Abc1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/docs?page=2",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2031-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Update destination only: omitted expiresAtUtc keeps the current expiration (200)
PUT {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/Abc1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/docs?page=3"
}

### Clear the expiration: explicit null means "never expires" (200)
PUT {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/Abc1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/docs?page=3",
  "expiresAtUtc": null
}

### Update validation failure (400): past expiration
PUT {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/Abc1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://example.com/",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Soft delete (204); repeating it also returns 204. Redirects then 404, analytics stay 200
DELETE {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/Abc1234

### Update or delete an unknown, wrong-case, malformed or (for PUT) deleted code (404)
DELETE {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/shorten/not-a-code

### Redirect (302 with Location) for an active code; replace with a code returned above
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/Abc1234

### Unknown, inactive, expired or malformed code (404)
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/not-a-code

### Click analytics (200) for an existing code, including inactive or expired ones
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/Abc1234

### Malformed or unknown code (404)
GET {{UrlShortener.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/analytics/not-a-code
